    "description": "The Regent (and Crown Prince) of the Malaysian State of Perlis, Tuanku Syed Faizuddin Putra, in his capacity as President of the Perlis State Islamic Council and Malay Customs Council, and Chancellor of Universiti Malaysia Perlis, led valuable discussions with academics at the Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations in London.",
